== Effects ==
* Fully charges the current [[activated item]].
* Spawns 2-4 random [[battery]] pickups.

== Notes ==
* Battery Pack's quality is considered 1 for the purposes of {{I|Bag of Crafting}}.

== Interactions ==
* {{I|Alabaster Box}} / {{I|Eraser}} / {{I|Notched Axe}}: No effect.
* {{I|Mega Blast}}: Will only give 3 ticks of charge.

== Trivia ==
* [[anti:Battery Pack|Battery Pack]] is from the ''Antibirth'' mod. In ''Antibirth'', its battery pickups were not random as there was only one kind of battery pickup.

